# SPA fallback for Cloudflare (Workers static assets and Pages).
#
# React Router uses real URLs (/gameboy/menu, /pokescan), so a hard refresh or
# a shared deep link must be answered with index.html instead of a 404.
#
# Each rule MUST be a single line, with 2 or 3 whitespace-separated tokens:
#   SOURCE  DESTINATION  [STATUS]
# Wrapping a rule onto a second line fails the upload with
# "Invalid _redirects configuration: Expected exactly 2 or 3 tokens".
/*    /index.html   200
